Z||000003||Patrick's Dad||06-13-2001||08:41 PM||||Best two? Hard to say....<P>Star Trek IV, The Voyage Home. Trek at it's best. Humor, chemistry, and a message without being preachy. I miss De.<P>Raiders of the Lost Ark. 'Nuff said.<P>The Naked Gun. All 3. Leslie Nielsen is a hoot. The Airplane! movies, too.<P>Schindler's List. The road leading to the camp made my blood boil. It was made of tombstones. On one hand, I had to keep reminding myself, "It's only a movie," but then, it's also history.<P>The worst movies are easy:<P>The Man Who Wasn't There. A 3D movie that made us wish that we weren't there.<P>Starship Troopers. I'm sure the book wasn't this bad. And Denise Richards wasn't in any of the naked scenes....||||reg||7
