Z||000018||Ken Wittlief||06-14-2001||10:01 AM||||the single worst movie ever: Pennock's FIERO Forum - The Movie!  (c%<P>  seriously, Walking Tall was aweful to sit through, all the smashing and crunching bones, and I kept thinking, when will this movie ever end, it just went on and on - very long and very graphically violent for its time.<P>   and then they blow his wifes brains out all over the dashboard. Maybe it was a factual movie, but it was not entertainment.<P><BR>   another movie I hated was looking for Mr Goodbar - you sit though the whole thing, and start getting some emphathy for Diane Ketons character, and then, like out of nowhere she is brutally murdered, and the movie ends there. <P>  Im walking out of the theater thinking: what the h#ll was that?!<P>It had no value - I felt like I had been setup for the sole purpose of being suckerpunched - like I had gone to a nice resturant, ordered the chefs special, and the chef comes out and punches me in the mouth and says, 'surprize! wasnt that different? I bet you didnt see that coming! would you like some dessert now?.<P>   Best movies? will have to think on that somemore.||||reg||1
